  <entry>
    <title>syzkaller入门</title>
    <link href="/2025/08/12/syzkaller%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/"/>
    <url>/2025/08/12/syzkaller%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="syzkaller-部署、使用、原理分析"><a href="#syzkaller-部署、使用、原理分析" class="headerlink" title="syzkaller 部署、使用、原理分析"></a>syzkaller 部署、使用、原理分析</h1><h2 id="源码安装"><a href="#源码安装" class="headerlink" title="源码安装"></a>源码安装</h2><h3 id="部署系统依赖组件"><a href="#部署系统依赖组件" class="headerlink" title="部署系统依赖组件"></a>部署系统依赖组件</h3><ul><li>首先更新软件源</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt update<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>安装版本控制组件</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install git<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install subversion<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>安装编译工具链</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install build-essential<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install gcc<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install g++<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install make<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install libssl-dev libelf-dev <span class="hljs-comment">##对ssl和内核模块进行支持</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>虚拟化与调试平台</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install qemu qemu-kvm<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install debootstrap<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>辅助工具</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install vim<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt install tree<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>导入go环境</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># cd / 回到主目录</span><br>wget https://dl.google.com/go/go1.20.1.linux-amd64.tar.gz<br>tar -xf go1.20.1.linux-amd64.tar.gz<br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> GOROOT=`<span class="hljs-built_in">pwd</span>`/go<br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> GOPATH=<span class="hljs-variable">$HOME</span>/go  <span class="hljs-comment"># 工作目录，可自定义</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">export</span> PATH=<span class="hljs-variable">$GOROOT</span>/bin:<span class="hljs-variable">$GOPATH</span>/bin:<span class="hljs-variable">$PATH</span><br>go version <span class="hljs-comment">#判断是否安装成功</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="使用源码安装syzkaller"><a href="#使用源码安装syzkaller" class="headerlink" title="使用源码安装syzkaller"></a>使用源码安装syzkaller</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># cd / 回到主目录</span><br>git <span class="hljs-built_in">clone</span> https://github.com/google/syzkaller.git<br><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> syzkaller/<br>make<br>tree ./bin/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>在Syzkaller目录下会出现一个bin目录，此目录中的内容如下图所示</p><p><img src="/../_posts/syzkaller%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/image1.png" alt="我是图片"></p><h2 id="使用方法"><a href="#使用方法" class="headerlink" title="使用方法"></a>使用方法</h2><h3 id="下载编译测试内核"><a href="#下载编译测试内核" class="headerlink" title="下载编译测试内核"></a>下载编译测试内核</h3><ul><li>下载内核</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">git <span class="hljs-built_in">clone</span> https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git <span class="hljs-comment">##网址可以根据情况更改</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>生成默认配置</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> linux<br>make defconfig <span class="hljs-comment">#生成默认的内核配置文件</span><br>make kvm_guest.config <span class="hljs-comment">#针对 KVM 虚拟机环境优化配置，将 KVM 虚拟机优化相关的配置写入 .config 文件中</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>插入以下设置<blockquote><p>打开.config文件，写入以下内容</p></blockquote></li></ul><figure class="highlight ini"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ini"><span class="hljs-attr">CONFIG_KCOV</span>=y<br><span class="hljs-attr">CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO</span>=y<br><span class="hljs-attr">CONFIG_KASAN</span>=y<br><span class="hljs-attr">CONFIG_UBSAN</span>=y<br><span class="hljs-attr">CONFIG_KASAN_INLINE</span>=y<br><span class="hljs-attr">CONFIG_KCOV_INSTRUMENT_ALL</span>=y<br><span class="hljs-attr">CONFIG_KCOV_ENABLE_COMPARISONS</span>=y<br><span class="hljs-attr">CONFIG_DEBUG_FS</span>=y<br><span class="hljs-attr">CONFIG_DEBUG_KMEMLEAK</span>=y<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>编译linux内核</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">make olddefconfig <span class="hljs-comment">#基于现有配置，自动处理新版本内核中新增的配置选项，生成一个与当前内核版本兼容的配置文件。</span><br>make -j4<br><span class="hljs-built_in">ls</span> vmlinux  <span class="hljs-comment">#未压缩的原始内核可执行文件</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">ls</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">arch</span>/x86/boot/bzImage  <span class="hljs-comment">#压缩后的内核镜像</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="配置测试虚拟机"><a href="#配置测试虚拟机" class="headerlink" title="配置测试虚拟机"></a>配置测试虚拟机</h2><h3 id="内核部署到虚拟机"><a href="#内核部署到虚拟机" class="headerlink" title="内核部署到虚拟机"></a>内核部署到虚拟机</h3><ul><li>更新软件源</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># cd /回到主目录</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> apt update<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>构建根文件系统<blockquote><p>这里会使用debootstrap构建最小根文件系统</p></blockquote></li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">mkdir</span> image-test<br><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> image-test/<br>wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/syzkaller/master/tools/create-image.sh -O create-image.sh<br><span class="hljs-built_in">chmod</span> +x create-image.sh<br>./create-image.sh<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>运行虚拟机<blockquote><p>最简单的脚本</p></blockquote></li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># boot.sh 运行</span><br>qemu-system-x86_64 \<br>    -m 2G \<br>    -smp 2 \<br>    -kernel /home/yuluoyang/linux/arch/x86/boot/bzImage \<br>    -append <span class="hljs-string">&quot;console=ttyS0 root=/dev/sda earlyprintk=serial net.ifnames=0&quot;</span> \<br>    -drive file=/home/yuluoyang/image-test/bullseye.img,format=raw \<br>    -net user,hostfwd=tcp:127.0.0.1:10021-:22 \<br>    -net nic,model=e1000 \<br>    -enable-kvm \<br>    -nographic \<br>    -pidfile /home/yuluoyang/vm.pid 2&gt;&amp;1 | <span class="hljs-built_in">tee</span> /home/yuluoyang/vm.log<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>内核（-kernel） 是 “操作系统核心”，负责硬件管理和底层功能</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>磁盘镜像（-drive） 是 “用户态系统”，包含应用程序、配置文件等</p></blockquote><h3 id="测试通信"><a href="#测试通信" class="headerlink" title="测试通信"></a>测试通信</h3><ul><li>新开终端</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> ssh -i image-test/bullseye.id_rsa -p 10021 -o <span class="hljs-string">&quot;StrictHostKeyChecking no&quot;</span> root@localhost<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>正常连上则说明主机和刚刚安装的虚拟机之间的通信没有问题</p></blockquote><ul><li>断开连接<br><code>exit</code></li></ul><h2 id="对内核进行fuzz"><a href="#对内核进行fuzz" class="headerlink" title="对内核进行fuzz"></a>对内核进行fuzz</h2><h3 id="准备工作"><a href="#准备工作" class="headerlink" title="准备工作"></a>准备工作</h3><ul><li>创建中间文件存储目录</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-comment"># cd / 回到主目录</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">mkdir</span> fuzzdir<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>syzkaller工作目录</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> syzkaller/<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">mkdir</span> workdir<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>新建配置文件setting.cfg<blockquote><p>内容如下</p></blockquote></li></ul><figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs json"><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;target&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;linux/amd64&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;http&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;127.0.0.1:56741&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span>  <br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;rpc&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;127.0.0.1:0&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span>       <br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;workdir&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/home/yuluoyang/syzkaller/workdir&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;kernel_obj&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/home/yuluoyang/linux&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span>  <br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;sshkey&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/home/yuluoyang/image-test/bullseye.id_rsa&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span> <br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;syzkaller&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/home/yuluoyang/syzkaller&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span>  <br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;sandbox&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;setuid&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span>        <br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;isolated&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span>            <br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;vm&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#123;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;targets&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">[</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;127.0.0.1:10021&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">]</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;pstore&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-literal"><span class="hljs-keyword">false</span></span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>        <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;target_dir&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/home/yuluoyang/fuzzdir&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span> <br>        <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;target_reboot&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-literal"><span class="hljs-keyword">false</span></span><br>    <span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;procs&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-number">8</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span>                 <br>    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;cover&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-literal"><span class="hljs-keyword">true</span></span>                 <br><span class="hljs-punctuation">&#125;</span><br>    <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="开始fuzz"><a href="#开始fuzz" class="headerlink" title="开始fuzz"></a>开始fuzz</h3><ul><li>执行fuzz</li></ul><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> syzkaller<br><span class="hljs-built_in">sudo</span> ./bin/syz-manager -config=setting.cfg<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li>监控数据上传<blockquote><p>访问 <a href="http://127.0.0.1:56741/">链接</a></p></blockquote></li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
